          "claim": "Hitting any enemy temporarily unlocks Sundering Slam."
        }
      ],
      "priority": "B",
      "priority_reason": "Its hit condition enables a second damaging cast.",
      "uncertainties": []
    },
    {
      "answer": "After Cunning Sweep hits an enemy, Ambessa can briefly cast Sundering Slam. This follow-up deals physical damage in a line, with increased damage to the first enemy hit.",
