      "answer": "Repudiation shields Ambessa as she braces, then smashes the ground to damage nearby enemies. If the shield absorbs champion, large-monster, or turret damage during bracing, the smash deals increased damage. Drakehound's Step can move the smash to her dash destination.",
      "build_focus": "",
      "card_id": "champ:ambessa:w:recognize:L2",
      "counterplay": "Avoid feeding damage into her bracing shield when possible, and leave space around her dash destination.",
      "facts": [
        {
          "basis": "source_assertion",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "Ambessa gains a shield, briefly braces herself, and then slams the ground to damage nearby enemies.",
              "source_id": "riot:W"
            }
          ],
          "claim": "Repudiation shields Ambessa as she braces, then smashes the ground to damage nearby enemies."
        },
        {
          "basis": "source_assertion",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "If the shield absorbs damage from a champion, large monster or turret during her bracing, the smash's damage is increased.",
              "source_id": "wiki:repudiation"
            }
          ],
          "claim": "If the shield absorbs champion, large-monster, or turret damage during bracing, the smash deals increased damage."
        },
        {
          "basis": "source_assertion",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "If she performs Drakehound's Step's dash during Repudiation, she will smash the ground at her destination instead.",
              "source_id": "wiki:repudiation"
            },
            {
              "quote": "Ambessa will smash the ground at the end of Drakehound's Step's dash if she would finish bracing during it, and otherwise always smashes the ground from wherever she is at the end of the bracing time.",
              "source_id": "wiki:repudiation"
            }
          ],
          "claim": "Drakehound's Step can move the smash to her dash destination."
        }
      ],
      "priority": "B",
      "priority_reason": "Attacking her shield can strengthen a repositionable retaliation.",
      "uncertainties": [
        "The smash occurs at dash completion if bracing would finish during the dash; otherwise it occurs wherever she is when bracing ends."
      ]
    },
