          "claim": "Lacerate spins around Ambessa, dealing physical damage and briefly slowing nearby enemies."
        },
        {
          "basis": "source_assertion",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "If Ambessa performs Drakehound's Step's dash after the spin, she will spin a second time upon arrival to apply the same effects.",
              "source_id": "wiki:lacerate"
            }
          ],
          "claim": "Using Drakehound's Step after the spin triggers another spin at the dash endpoint, repeating the damage and slow."
        }
      ],
      "priority": "B",
      "priority_reason": "The dash repeats her nearby damage and slow.",
      "uncertainties": [
        "The second spin still occurs if the dash is interrupted."
      ]
    },
    {
      "answer": "Public Execution passively grants armor penetration and healing from active-ability damage. After preparing a line strike, Ambessa blinks behind the farthest enemy champion in its area, suppresses them, then slams them for damage and a stun. During preparation and the target's suppression, she is immune to displacement and unable to act.",
      "build_focus": "",
      "card_id": "champ:ambessa:r:recognize:L2",
      "counterplay": "Move out of the strike's line and consider which ally is farthest within it.",
      "facts": [
        {
          "basis": "source_assertion",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "Passive: Ambessa gains armor penetration and heals for a percentage of the damage dealt by her active abilities.",
              "source_id": "wiki:publicexecution"
            }
          ],
          "claim": "Public Execution passively grants armor penetration and healing from active-ability damage."
        },
        {
          "basis": "source_assertion",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "Active: Ambessa prepares a strike in a line in the target direction, then blinks behind the farthest enemy champion within the area and seizes them.",
              "source_id": "wiki:publicexecution"
            },
            {
              "quote": "Ambessa blinks to the farthest enemy champion in a line of her choosing and suppresses them upon her arrival. She then slams the enemy into the ground where they take damage and are stunned.",
              "source_id": "riot:R"
            }
          ],
          "claim": "After preparing a line strike, Ambessa blinks behind the farthest enemy champion in its area, suppresses them, then slams them for damage and a stun."
        },
