          "claim": "During preparation and the target's suppression, she is immune to displacement and unable to act."
        }
      ],
      "priority": "A",
      "priority_reason": "Farthest-target selection can expose a backline champion to suppression.",
      "uncertainties": [
        "Preventing suppression prevents attachment, damage, and stun, but the blink still occurs.",
        "Removing suppression early detaches the target and cancels the ability.",
        "Passive healing is reduced against minions and monsters."
      ]
    }
